---
import Layout from '../../layouts/UndergroundLayout.astro';
import Invitation from '../../components/underground/Invitation.astro';
import Process from '../../components/underground/Process.astro';
import Proof from '../../components/agency/ResponsiveStudy.astro';
const principles=[{label:'01 / INTENTION',title:'Start with a reason.',text:'The brand, the audience, and the purpose of the website shape the direction. Every visual choice has a job to do.'},{label:'02 / EXPRESSION',title:'Make a clear choice.',text:'A distinctive point of view connects the imagery, the interface, and the words. One language, many ways to express it.'},{label:'03 / EXPERIENCE',title:'Care for the details.',text:'Navigation, responsive layouts, accessible controls, and a considered handover complete the experience.'}];
---
<Layout title="The studio — WebDECOR" active="studio"><section class="u-page-cover" data-window="Studio / Independent by design"><span class="u-meta">02 / THE PEOPLE BEHIND THE PIXELS</span><h1>STUDIO<span class="u-hand-note">no default<br/>settings.</span></h1><div class="u-cover-split"><div><h2>Human instinct.<br/>Digital expression.</h2><p>WebDECOR is a web design practice for brands that want their website to feel like their own. Strategy, art direction, and development belong in the same conversation.</p><p>The internet used to be a place to discover something unexpected. We think it still should be.</p></div><figure class="u-paper-image"><img src="/images/crt-eye.webp" alt="A grainy monochrome study of a human eye" width="1280" height="1280"/><figcaption class="u-meta">HUMAN AT THE SOURCE / INDEPENDENT BY DESIGN</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class="u-editorial-section u-paper-section u-manifesto" data-window="Readme / The point of view"><span class="u-meta">THE POINT OF VIEW</span><h2>Make it feel<br/><em>like someone.</em></h2><div><p>A typeface. A crop. A line of copy. The rhythm between pages. The moment an interaction makes sense.</p><p>Character comes from those decisions working together. We look for a strong idea, then carry it through the entire website.</p><p>We connect curious thinking with precise execution. A strong idea, a considered experience, and the craft to make the whole thing work.</p></div></section><section class="u-principles u-editorial-section" aria-label="Design principles" data-window="Studio / Design principles">{principles.map(item=><article><span class="u-meta">{item.label}</span><h2>{item.title}</h2><p>{item.text}</p></article>)}</section><section class="u-editorial-section u-studio-proof" data-window="Studio / Human at the source"><div><span class="u-meta">IN PRACTICE / RESPONSIVE DESIGN</span><h2>Same character.<br/>Different canvas.</h2><p>A website has to hold together beyond its first screen. Switch between wide and compact layouts to see the hierarchy adapt while the identity stays intact.</p><a class="u-action" href="/weird-internet/services/#build">EXPLORE THE BUILD</a></div><Proof id="underground-studio-proof"/></section><Process/><Invitation/></Layout>
